  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delivery of safety cooperation and services to NGOs in Mali, Burkina Faso and Niger</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to NGO safety coordination platforms in the Sahel region, to provide essential services and training to Sahel based NGOs, including high-quality, real time information and analyses on the security context in the Sahel, and sharing and coordinating this information with the NGO community to improve collective security and access.</narrative>
  </description>
